# Verification scratch left by build agents.
# Everything real lives in src/, tests/, functions/ or public/, so a loose
# script or screenshot at the project root is always throwaway. Negations keep
# the two root files that are genuinely part of the project.
/*.mjs
!/astro.config.mjs
/*.png
/*.jpg
